# Production build for the BGC Crypto SPA.
#
# The SPA is served by the Flask backend from the SAME origin as the API, so
# the API base URL must be empty → all requests use relative paths (/api/...).
# Do NOT point this at an ephemeral tunnel (e.g. *.trycloudflare.com); that URL
# rotates and will break production API reachability. If the API is ever hosted
# on a separate stable domain, set it here (e.g. https://api.yourdomain.com).
VITE_API_URL=
